   raw pasted HTML alone cannot resolve its relative images or fixture font.
2. Capture the source browser with the same three widths (1440, 768, 390),
   device scale 1, and compare it with the matching checked-in screenshot at
   100% zoom. Record `google-chrome --version`; the initial references report
